  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.4.0:\n  - Added OpenTelemetry ActivitySource spans for notification dispatch, queue enqueue/dequeue, and background queue processing.\n  - Added AWS X-Ray trace propagation for SQS through AWSTraceHeader and W3C trace context metadata.\n  - Added PostgreSQL preference store DI helpers and file-template options-lambda overload.\n  - Updated MailKit dependency to remediate known MailKit/MimeKit/BouncyCastle vulnerability advisories.\n\n  v2.1.0:\n  - Added AWS SQS queue backend via UseAwsSqsQueue() and AwsSqsNotificationQueue.\n  - Added per-tenant email routing via UsePerTenantEmail() tenant sender resolution.\n  - Added notification preference/opt-out pipeline via INotificationPreferenceStore and in-memory default.\n\n  v2.0.0:\n  - Standardized Framework Release.\n  - Renamed all packages to PrimusSaaS.* namespace.\n  - Synchronized versions across the entire suite.\n  - Enhanced metadata and fixed consistency issues.",
